  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "微處理機系統實習",
    "sub_ename": "THE EXPERIMENT OF MICRO-PROCESSOR SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "首先介紹In-Circuit-Emulator, Target Board, Driver等實習相關儀器的使用方法,再利用這些設備先練習軟體程式的設計並熟悉微處理機的硬體與指令,最後將所有系統整合設計一具有input/output功能的系統,完成一小專題.",
    "describe_eh": "The first step in this course is to introduce all instruments used. It includes In-Circuit-Emulator, Target Board, System Driver.\nThen do more practice and experiment in programming in assembly language.\nTo study the microprocessor operation by these experiments.\nFinally, to design an in-based system equipped with input and output device.\n",
    "pre_subname": "IEE1006邏輯設計",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IEE1006",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IEE1006 LOGIC DESIGN",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
